From 459929cf7d0f60ee6eb5d19e7d5b177e152d5ae4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwen38-4090 <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 17:37:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/49] GDN: chunked (WY-form) verify record behind
 NINFER_GDN_CHUNKED_RECORD=1

Unrolls the gated delta rule along each column root path: Gram matrices and
s0 projections on tensor cores (fp32 state as bf16 hi+lo), a 16x16 forward
substitution for the deltas, then outputs. Records and prefetch are written
as in the staged kernel. Bench (27B geometry, width 16): out rel.err 4.8e-5,
records identical; 6.3 us vs staged 12-20 us.
